#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Release signing — never commit
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
android/key.properties
/dist/
rust/prism_core/target

# Rust build artifacts
rust/prism_core/target/
rust/**/target/

# Packer input — real credentials, never commit (use the .example)
tool/prism.secret.json

# NOTE: android/app/src/main/jniLibs is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The sealed libprism_core.so must ship with the repo so every
# release build contains the gate (a missing .so silently drops
# every user into the white game). Build it with tool/build_rust.ps1.
